  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection from Sexual Exploitation, Abuse and Harassment (SEAH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Areas for improvement on PSEAH and AAP systems identified through country reviews in three pilot countries, using the CHS and its PSEAH index (based on the views of people affected by crisis).

Outcome 2: Pilot countries show a demonstrable improvement in context appropriate PSEAH and AAP systems that address prevention and response.

Outcome 3: The global humanitarian sector shows tangible progress on improving PSEAH and AAP</narrative>
  </description>
